  "releaseNotes": "- BREAKING: The internal virtual methods of the HostRunner are now taking the options callback as well.\n- BREAKING: AutoRegisterDefaultServices is now true by default.\n- BREAKING: The options method AddMandatoryServices() now needs the runner instance to be passed to it.\n- BuildHost() can be overridden in runner.\n- OpenTelemetry is now configured here.\n- Runner has new overrides for OnInternalOpenTelemetryConfiguration, OnInternalOpenTelemetryTracingConfiguration and OnInternalOpenTelemetryMeterConfiguration",
